[00:00.00] 作词 : Mark Foster/Hugo Leclercq
[00:00.00] 作曲 : Mark Foster/Hugo Leclercq
[00:00.00][Verse 1]
[00:00.00][by:takidesu_]
[00:05.58]Well, I am here for you
[00:05.58]看，我在这里守候着你
[00:09.82]Open up your eyes and don't look away
[00:09.82]张开双眼，注视着我
[00:15.35]I'm dripping down from the fangs
[00:15.35]我破碎的灵魂从水泵中流出
[00:20.56]When I hear your name, I feel the pain
[00:20.56]当我听到你的名字，感受着疼痛
[00:25.96]And I'm crawling on the floor just thinking that
[00:25.96]我在地板上艰难的爬行
[00:28.52]I'm a fool
[00:28.52]只是在想着自己的愚蠢
[00:31.58]But I'll wash myself and I'll stand again
[00:31.58]但我会用尽全力再重新站起来
[00:37.34]After flying with angels
[00:37.34]在与天使飞翔后
[00:43.10]And I'm backing out the corner
[00:43.10]我重新回到你身边
[00:45.30]Don't you think that I'm a runner
[00:45.30]不要再奢望我会逃跑
[00:46.94]I'll be coming with my guns up
[00:46.94]我将会满怀着信心
[00:48.52]Shooting at the moon to bring the sun up
[00:48.52]我们会突破困境，重新见到阳光
[00:50.56]Fall back and close your eyes
[00:50.56]张开手臂倒下吧
[00:53.42]I'm at the bottom, we can hide and be forgotten
[00:53.42]我们可以向冬眠的动物一样消失
[00:56.32]Come closer, say my name
[00:56.32]来到我的身边，呼唤我的名字
[00:58.82]Say it forever, we can run away together
[00:58.82]呼唤我的名字，我可以将你永远的带离这个世界
[01:01.90]And keep on crushing on our love like this
[01:01.90]我将一直这样展现自己对你的迷恋
[01:03.90]On our love like this, on our love like this
[01:03.90]展示着我的痴迷，渴望着你的回应
[01:06.96]I'll keep on crushing on our love like this
[01:06.96]就这样展示着我对你的迷恋
[01:09.58]We don't need to say the words cause we're speaking nonsense
[01:09.58]我们不需要语言因为那些都是废话
[01:12.78][Verse 2]
[01:17.58]Well, you said before
[01:17.58]让我放下戒备
[01:21.08]To let down and close my eyes
[01:21.08]当我在你的身边
[01:23.38]Well I am here
[01:23.38]你霸占着我破碎的心
[01:26.34]Grabbing at my chest with a broken heart
[01:26.34]让我充满了恐惧
[01:32.12]And I'm filled with fears
[01:32.12]我曾经像老鼠一样被肆意玩弄
[01:34.90]I've been ripped up and tossed like a mouse
[01:34.90]想要到达天堂，又怕被抛下地狱
[01:37.42]Wrestled with the heavens and the devil himself
[01:37.42]我在你的声音里瑟瑟发抖
[01:39.86]Your voice can break my bones
[01:39.86]然后你开始说话，一种力量涌了进来
[01:44.40]When you speak a force rushes in and slowly
[01:44.40]将我撕成碎片
[01:49.92]Rips me to pieces
[01:49.92]现在我愿意献出我的生命
[01:54.26]I would give my life to another
[01:54.26]只是为了证明我不是懦夫
[01:57.10]Just to prove I'm not a runner
[01:57.10]我将会满怀着信心
[01:58.40]I'll be coming with my guns up
[01:58.40]我们会突破困境，重新见到阳光
[02:00.20]Shooting at the moon to bring the sun up
[02:00.20]张开手臂倒下吧
